|               | (1) array partition         | 11,101       | user array partition pragmas are applied                                               |
|               | (2) simplification          |  6,892       | simplification of applied user array partition & struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas |
|               | (3) aggregate/disaggregate  |  6,894       | user struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied                                 |
|               | (4) array reshape           |  6,923       | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns         |  6,449       | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                             |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
|               | (1) loop simplification     |  6,120       | loop and instruction simplification                                                    |
|               | (2) parallelization         |  6,367       | loops are unrolled or pipelined to meet performance targets                            |
