|               | (4) simplification          |  6,090       | simplification of design after performance transformations                             |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| HW Transforms |                             |              | After hardware transfomations                                                          |
|               | (1) lowering                |  6,200       | initial conversion to HW specific instructions                                         |
|               | (2) optimizations           |  6,430       | high level synthesis optimizations                                                     |
